# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Raw instrument data is NOT redistributed - see "Data availability" in README.
# The cached artefacts under Data/processed/ are tracked instead, so every
# reported result can be reproduced without the raw exports.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.bmp
Data/raw/
data/raw/

# Any artefact from which the facility's measurement values can be recovered is
# withheld on the same basis as the raw exports:
#   clean_stack        - the decoded ion counts themselves
#   02b_pca_components - full-rank PCA, so scores @ loadings inverts exactly
#   02b_nmf_components - W @ H reconstructs raw counts at r = 0.978
#   01_summary_stats   - direct per-channel min/max/mean/median/std
Data/processed/fossilfly_clean_stack.npz
data/processed/fossilfly_clean_stack.npz
Data/processed/02b_pca_components.npz
data/processed/02b_pca_components.npz
Data/processed/02b_nmf_components.npz
data/processed/02b_nmf_components.npz
Data/processed/01_summary_statistics.csv
data/processed/01_summary_statistics.csv

# Generated figures are large and fully regenerable; the report figures used in
# the write-up are kept in docs/figures/ instead.
Data/processed/*.png
data/processed/*.png

# Superseded figure directory (outputs now go to the configured figures_dir)
notebooks/analysis/figures/
